<br>
        possible tool a purpose, and to any object both material and form <=
br>
        places. &nbsp;I backed off from this somewhat. &nbsp;I thus avoided=
 &gt;5 place <br>
        predicates. &nbsp;At about this point, the current concept of BAI s=
